OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain this evening and the
OL,7,Ffirst part of the night. Drier weather
OL,8,Fwith a few showers will spread from
OL,9,Fthe west later. Fresh to strong south
OL,10,Fto southwest winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FSome bright or sunny spells
OL,13,Fand passing showers, these most
OL,14,Ffrequent across Shetland. Fewer
OL,15,Fshowers in the afternoon. Fresh to
OL,16,Fstrong south to southwest winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
