OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,6,FSaturday brings showers, perhaps
OL,7,Fthundery for the morning. Showers or
OL,8,Flonger periods of rain for Sunday,
OL,9,Fcoupled with strong southerly winds.
OL,10,FMonday mainly dry with brighter spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
